Findings (7) and fixes at fcea0d3
---------------------------------
F1 HIGH    LSP `active/debug/steps` used Engine::new() (ambient env), so a
           step could show a host value hover/diagnostics report as null.
           Fixed: Engine::hermetic() + wall clock off.
           Test: step_bridge_is_hermetic_for_environment_reads.
F2 HIGH    Formatter Enum branch returned before the shared argument list,
           dropping default/description/requires (changing requiredness,
           defaults, and descriptions; `fmt --check schemas/*` failed).
           Fixed: Enum renders the same arguments as other leaves.
           Tests: enum_fields_keep_every_accepted_argument,
           every_shipped_schema_round_trips_through_the_formatter.
F3 MEDIUM  Semantic `'''` verbatim form containing a CR normalized it to LF
           (value change + non-idempotence). Fixed: CR payloads use the
           escaped `"""` path.
           Test: semantic_multiline_with_a_carriage_return_keeps_its_value.
F4 MEDIUM  Brace output was not idempotent when a table's trailing comment
           followed its last nested block (the next parse moved it inside).
           Fixed: comments are hoisted into the nested block (the fixed
           point) and empty nested tables emit `key = {}`.
           Tests: brace_trailing_note_after_a_nested_block_is_idempotent,
           brace_empty_tables_keep_inter_entry_comments_idempotent.
F5 MEDIUM  59-64-level nested expressions overflowed the 1 MiB main stack
           in unoptimized builds. Fixed: CLI and LSP run commands on a
           32 MiB worker stack; 64 levels yield E004, never a crash.
           Test: deep_expression_nesting_fails_with_e004_instead_of_overflowing.
F6 LOW     `--break budget:0` was accepted although the range is 1-100.
           Fixed: 0 matches nothing; test updated in
           budget_breakpoints_match_on_count_and_percent.
F7 LOW     L016 absolute/parent-escape branches were unreachable because
           `lint` had no parse opt-in. Fixed: `lint --allow-parent-escapes`.
           Test: lint_can_report_include_escapes_when_the_parser_allows_them.

Docs updated with the fixes: spec/budgets.md (stack requirement),
spec/linter.md and docs/lint-rules.md (lint parse flag), spec/lsp.md
(hermetic debugger bridge).

